1
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:06,030
-Hey. -Hi.
-嘿 -嗨

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,330
-What are you doing? -I was thinking of moving the couch.
-你在做什麼？ -我想把沙發搬開

3
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:11,900
Why would you want to do that?
你為什麼要那麼做？

4
00:00:12,110 --> 00:00:14,540
So there'd be a decent place for me to sit?
那樣子我就有好位置可以坐了？

5
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:20,070
-Rach, there is a decent place. -And your lap does not count.
-瑞秋，你本來就有好位置坐了 -你的大腿不算

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:24,610
-Come on, help me move this. -No, no, no.
-來吧，幫我把它搬開 -不

7
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:26,180
-No? -No.
-你不要？ -我不要

8
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:28,080
Rosita does not move.
蘿希塔不想移開

9
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:33,590
I'm sorry. Rosita? As in..?
對不起，蘿希塔，它是…？

10
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:36,160
As in "Rosita does not move."
就是「不想動的蘿希塔」

11
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:38,520
It's just a chair. What's the big deal?
它只是一張椅子 它有什麼大不了的？

12
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:42,230
It's the exact equal distance from the bathroom to the kitchen...
它到浴室跟到廚房的距離是一樣的…

13
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:47,530
and it's at an angle where you don't get any glare coming off Stevie.
而且它的角度讓你完全 看不到史提夫的閃光

14
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:50,010
Stevie the TV?
電視機史提夫？

15
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:54,280
-Is there a problem? -No.
-有問題嗎？ -沒有

16
00:00:57,620 --> 00:00:58,850
What does he know?
他又知道什麼？

17
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:02,280
Come on, Rosita. Us chicas gotta stick together.
來吧，蘿希塔 我們這些辣妹得合作才行

18
00:01:11,030 --> 00:01:13,470
You bitch!
你這個臭女人！

19
00:01:15,370 --> 00:01:17,530
The One Where Rosita Dies
本集播出：蘿希塔之死

00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:19,530
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

20
00:01:53,310 --> 00:01:54,300
Hey, Ross?
嘿，羅斯？

21
00:01:54,540 --> 00:01:56,980
I checked the real estate section.
我看過房地產廣告版

22
00:01:57,750 --> 00:01:58,940
Look at this.
你看這個

23
00:01:59,150 --> 00:02:00,880
Looks like Mom and Dad's house.
看起來好像爸媽的房子

24
00:02:01,150 --> 00:02:04,520
Even has a tree with a broken limb out front.
院子裡的樹 正前方也有根斷掉的樹枝

25
00:02:04,750 --> 00:02:08,590
And the window in the attic...
閣樓的窗戶…

26
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:11,050
Oh, my God!
喔，我的天啊！

27
00:02:11,530 --> 00:02:14,520
What happened to the window in the attic?
閣樓的窗戶怎麼了？

28
00:02:15,230 --> 00:02:19,190
-I can't believe they're selling it. -And they didn't tell us.
-我不敢相信他們要把它賣掉 -卻沒有告訴我們

29
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,990
What happened to the window in the attic?
閣樓的窗戶怎麼了？

30
00:02:24,170 --> 00:02:26,040
I'll buy you a new one, okay?
我會買張新椅子賠你，好嗎？

31
00:02:26,270 --> 00:02:29,710
We'll go to the store and get you a new chair right now.
我們馬上到店裡去 幫你買一張新椅子

32
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:35,540
She's not even cold yet.
她還屍骨未寒

33
00:02:37,220 --> 00:02:40,350
Wouldn't Rosita have wanted you to move on?
蘿希塔不希望你繼續過你的日子嗎？

34
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:45,050
I mean, you know, she did always put your comfort first.
我是說她永遠 把你的幸福放在第一順位

35
00:02:47,260 --> 00:02:48,700
That's true.
沒錯

36
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:56,940
I can't believe we have to say goodbye to the house we grew up in.
我不敢相信 我們得跟小時候的家說再見

37
00:02:57,140 --> 00:03:00,040
Man, some stranger's gonna be in my room.
天啊，有個陌生人 就要搬進我的房間裡

38
00:03:00,310 --> 00:03:03,140
For 15 years they kept it as a shrine to you.
十五年來，他們把你房間 弄得跟神龕差不多

39
00:03:03,380 --> 00:03:05,870
It's time the velvet ropes came down.
現在一切都該落幕了

40
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,570
They kept your room a while.
他們也保留你房間有一陣子

41
00:03:08,780 --> 00:03:13,380
Please! Dad turned my room into a gym 20 minutes after I moved out.
拜託，我搬出來二十分鐘後 爸就把我的房間變成健身房

42
00:03:13,620 --> 00:03:17,750
I gotta say, a tanning bed and a stack of Victoria's Secret catalogs?
我很懷疑，一張日光浴椅 跟一堆維多利亞秘密的目錄？

43
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,320
Not a gym.
那不是健身房

44
00:03:20,130 --> 00:03:23,590
-Come on. You know they love you. -As much as they love you?
-別這樣，你知道他們愛你 -就跟他們愛你一樣？

45
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:27,890
They thought she was barren until I was born. It's not my fault.
我沒出生前，他們以為她不會生 那不是我的錯

46
00:03:31,170 --> 00:03:32,970
I hate this year.
我討厭今年

47
00:03:33,170 --> 00:03:34,840
What's wrong with this year?
今年有什麼不對的？

48
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:38,340
It's February and I've only given two massages...
現在已經是二月 我只接到兩個按摩客人…

49
00:03:38,580 --> 00:03:40,910
and they were both horrible tippers.
而且他們給小費都給得很吝嗇

50
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,450
That was me and Ross.
你是指我跟羅斯

51
00:03:44,490 --> 00:03:46,680
Oh, that's right.
喔，沒錯

52
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,820
If you want some extra cash...
如果你需要錢…

53
00:03:49,090 --> 00:03:52,620
some college friends made good money doing telemarketing.
我大學的朋友 做電話行銷賺了不少錢

54
00:03:53,130 --> 00:03:55,990
It'd be better than the last telephone job I had.
它一定比上次 我做的電話行銷工作還棒

55
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:59,130
I probably won't have to say "spank" as much.
或許我不必常常說「打我屁股吧」

56
00:04:02,570 --> 00:04:03,940
What?
什麼？

57
00:04:04,510 --> 00:04:07,170
Oh, yeah, like you never called.
對，你從來沒打過那種電話

58
00:04:13,820 --> 00:04:16,780
This is very easy. You read from the script...
這真的很簡單，你只要照著稿子念…

59
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:19,650
and try to sell as much toner as you can.
試著多賣一點碳粉

60
00:04:19,850 --> 00:04:21,520
Okay, I can do that.
好吧，我辦得到

61
00:04:21,790 --> 00:04:25,090
By the way, I love my office.
對了，我喜歡我的辦公室

62
00:04:25,330 --> 00:04:28,390
-Why don't we do a trial run? -Oh, okay.
-我們為什麼不來練習一下？ -好吧

63
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:31,960
All right.
好了

64
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:35,100
Hi, this is Phoebe from Empire Office Supplies.
嗨，我是帝國辦公室文具公司的菲比

65
00:04:35,340 --> 00:04:39,330
-Can I speak to your supply manager? -I'm the supply manager.
-請問總務部經理在嗎？ -我就是總務部經理

66
00:04:39,570 --> 00:04:41,770
I'd like to talk about your toner needs.
我想跟你談談買碳粉的事

67
00:04:41,940 --> 00:04:42,930
We don't need any.
我們不需要碳粉

68
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:45,240
Okay, sorry to bother you. Bye-bye.
好吧，抱歉打擾你了，再見

69
00:04:46,350 --> 00:04:47,680
Yeah, you're right. This is easy.
你說的對，這真的很容易

70
00:04:47,950 --> 00:04:50,920
Okay. What was wrong with that call?
好吧，那通電話哪裡不對勁呢？

71
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,480
Oh, well, all right.
好吧

72
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:56,160
No offense, but you were kind of rude.
我沒有惡意，但你的態度真的很不好

73
00:04:57,660 --> 00:05:00,560
They always say they don't need toner. That's okay.
他們永遠都會說 他們不需要碳粉，沒關係

74
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:05,320
Whatever they say, you can find the answer to it, here in the script.
不管他們說什麼 你都會在稿子裡找到標準解答

75
00:05:05,630 --> 00:05:08,070
So I think you're ready to sell toner.
我想你準備好要賣碳粉了

76
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,300
-Do you have any last questions? -No.
-你還有問題嗎？ -沒有了

77
00:05:10,570 --> 00:05:12,840
Wait, yes, I do have one question:
等一下，對了，我的確有一個問題

78
00:05:13,110 --> 00:05:14,630
What is toner?
什麼是碳粉？

79
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:19,270
Joey?
喬伊？

80
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:22,410
Joe?
喬伊？

81
00:05:26,850 --> 00:05:28,650
Full bag?
原封未動？

82
00:05:30,290 --> 00:05:32,620
Beer's still cold.
啤酒還是冰的

83
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:37,460
Something terrible must have happened here.
這裡一定發生了很可怕的事

84
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:47,770
Oh, no, no, no!
喔，不…

85
00:05:50,610 --> 00:05:53,270
Stevie, I was never here.
史提夫，我沒來過這裡

86
00:05:57,290 --> 00:05:59,850
-Dad? -I'm here!
-爸？ -我在這裡！

87
00:06:00,490 --> 00:06:02,010
-Hey. -Hi.
-嘿 -嗨

88
00:06:02,290 --> 00:06:06,590
Seems like just yesterday you guys used to come out to watch me work.
感覺上好像以前你們 跑來這裡看我工作的時候

89
00:06:06,790 --> 00:06:09,190
We can't believe you're selling the house.
我們不敢相信你們要賣掉房子

90
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:11,260
Time for a new family to start here.
也該讓新的家庭 在這裡開始他們的新生活了

91
00:06:11,530 --> 00:06:14,730
I hope their check clears before they find the crack...
我希望在支票兌現前 他們不會發現…

92
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:17,770
in the foundation and the asbestos in the ceiling.
地基有裂痕，天花板的石棉瓦破了

93
00:06:19,710 --> 00:06:22,570
Let's grab our stuff and get the hell out of here.
我們快把東西拿一拿，離開這裡吧

94
00:06:23,110 --> 00:06:26,550
-Sorry we can't store your things. -Oh, it's okay.
-抱歉我們不能收藏你們的東西 -沒關係

95
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:28,940
I can't wait to see everything again.
我等不及要再看到那些東西了

96
00:06:29,220 --> 00:06:31,120
I don't know what's down here.
我不知道這裡放了什麼

97
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:35,050
But there are six or seven Easy-Bake Ovens in the attic.
但閣樓上有六，七箱簡易烘焙烤箱

98
00:06:36,060 --> 00:06:38,080
I used to love to play restaurant.
我以前最喜歡玩開餐廳的遊戲了

99
00:06:38,290 --> 00:06:41,390
Not as much as you loved to play "uncooked batter eater."
但你最愛的還是「吃麵粉糊」

100
00:06:42,730 --> 00:06:47,000
You can't expect a child to wait for a light bulb to cook brownies.
你不能要求小孩子 等著電燈泡把餅乾烤好

101
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:51,230
So I think your boxes are over here.
我想你的箱子應該都在這裡

102
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,840
Oh, great.
太棒了

103
00:06:53,070 --> 00:06:54,770
Hey...
嘿…

104
00:06:54,980 --> 00:06:57,000
whose cigarettes are these?
這是誰的煙？

105
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:01,140
I don't know.
我不知道

106
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:03,780
They must be your mother's.
一定是你媽的

107
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:08,750
But please, please don't ask her. I'll throw these away.
但求求你別去質問她 我來把煙丟掉

108
00:07:12,730 --> 00:07:16,090
Cool! Dad, my report cards!
酷啊！爸，是我的成績單！

109
00:07:16,330 --> 00:07:17,730
Hey, check this out.
嘿，快來看看

110
00:07:17,930 --> 00:07:23,130
Math, "A." Science, "A." History, "A." Gym...
數學「優等」，自然「優等」 歷史「優等」，體育…

111
00:07:29,140 --> 00:07:31,940
My rock polisher!
我的磨石機！

112
00:07:35,650 --> 00:07:37,680
-Uh-oh. -What?
-慘了 -怎麼了？

113
00:07:37,890 --> 00:07:40,120
You know how the garage floods every spring?
你知道每年春天車庫都會淹水嗎？

114
00:07:40,290 --> 00:07:43,380
How are you ever gonna sell this place?
你要怎麼把房子賣掉？

115
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:46,420
I think I accidentally used Monica's boxes...
我想我不小心拿摩妮卡的箱子…

116
00:07:46,690 --> 00:07:49,090
to keep the water away from the Porsche.
來擋水，免得保時捷進了水

117
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:55,060
Oh, no, Dad. Dad?
喔，不，爸，爸？

118
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,230
What the..
搞什麼…

119
00:07:56,470 --> 00:08:00,810
Oh, God. Everything's ruined!
喔，天啊，一切都毀了！

120
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:03,270
Dad, she's gonna be crushed.
爸，她一定會崩潰的

121
00:08:05,150 --> 00:08:07,270
You don't secretly smoke, do you?
你該不會是偷偷在抽煙吧？

122
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,610
No.
不

123
00:08:10,790 --> 00:08:12,950
So it's just your mother then.
是你媽在抽煙

124
00:08:16,420 --> 00:08:19,830
Hi. This is Phoebe from Empire Office Supplies.
嗨，我是帝國辦公室文具公司的菲比

125
00:08:20,030 --> 00:08:22,960
Can I speak to your supply manager, please?
請問總務部經理在嗎？

126
00:08:24,030 --> 00:08:26,000
Earl. Thanks.
厄爾，謝謝

127
00:08:26,730 --> 00:08:30,730
Hi, Earl. This is Phoebe from Empire Office Supplies.
嗨，厄爾，我是帝國辦公室 文具公司的菲比

128
00:08:30,970 --> 00:08:33,530
I'd like to talk to you about your toner needs.
我想跟你談談買碳粉的事

129
00:08:33,940 --> 00:08:36,270
I don't need any toner.
我不需要碳粉

130
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:42,110
I hear what you're saying, but at our prices, everyone needs toner.
我知道了，但是聽了我們的價格 大家都會想買碳粉

131
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:44,940
Not me.
我不要

132
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:47,050
May I ask why?
能請問你為什麼嗎？

133
00:08:47,290 --> 00:08:49,810
You want to know why?
你想知道為什麼？

134
00:08:50,530 --> 00:08:51,860
You want to know why?
你想知道為什麼？

135
00:08:52,060 --> 00:08:53,990
I surely do.
我真的很想

136
00:08:54,660 --> 00:08:55,690
Okay.
好吧

137
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:59,030
I don't need any toner...
我不需要碳粉…

138
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:01,330
because I'm gonna kill myself.
因為我就要自殺了

139
00:09:14,050 --> 00:09:16,710
Is that because you're out of toner?
那是因為你的碳粉用完了嗎？

140
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:26,550
Okay, so no toner today. Thanks anyway. Bye-bye.
好吧，今天我不需要碳粉 謝謝你，再見

141
00:09:26,830 --> 00:09:31,320
Wait, wait! I can't let you hang up. Just please talk to me.
等一下！我不能讓你掛電話 請你跟我說話

142
00:09:31,770 --> 00:09:32,990
Well...
喔…

143
00:09:34,270 --> 00:09:36,200
I only had one thing to do today.
今天我只需要做一件事

144
00:09:36,409 --> 00:09:38,877
（今天的工作 自殺）

145
00:09:39,410 --> 00:09:42,170
I guess I could push it back.
我猜我能把它延期一下吧

146
00:09:42,610 --> 00:09:45,340
Yeah. Now, why do you want to kill yourself?
好吧，你為什麼要自殺？

147
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:49,970
I've been working for 10 years now at this...
十年來，我一直在做…

148
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:52,240
meaningless, dead-end job...
這份沒有意義又沒有前途的工作…

149
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:55,580
and nobody here even knows that I exist.
辦公室裡的人根本不知道我的存在

150
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:58,280
Chandler?
錢德？

151
00:10:02,900 --> 00:10:04,920
I'm sorry?
你說什麼？

152
00:10:06,530 --> 00:10:07,900
Look...
聽著…

153
00:10:08,100 --> 00:10:10,630
I'm sure that people know you exist.
我相信他們都知道你的存在

154
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:13,000
Oh, yeah? I work in a cubicle...
是嗎？我在一個小房間工作…

155
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,710
surrounded by people.
四周都是人

156
00:10:14,940 --> 00:10:19,110
I've been talking to you for five minutes now about killing myself...
我已經跟你談了五分鐘 我要自殺的問題…

157
00:10:19,750 --> 00:10:23,010
and no one's even looked up from their desk. Hang on.
沒有人抬頭起來看我一眼，等一下

158
00:10:23,220 --> 00:10:25,010
Hey, everybody...
嘿，大伙們…

159
00:10:25,220 --> 00:10:26,710
I'm gonna kill myself.
我要自殺了

160
00:10:31,430 --> 00:10:32,720
I got nothing.
他們不理我

161
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:37,620
Good chair.
好漂亮的椅子

162
00:10:38,230 --> 00:10:39,760
Now, if anybody asks...
好了，如果有人問起…

163
00:10:40,030 --> 00:10:42,760
your name is Rosita.
你的名字就叫蘿希塔

164
00:11:06,090 --> 00:11:08,990
Poor thing. Cut down in her prime.
可憐的小東西，她是英年早逝

165
00:11:10,700 --> 00:11:13,290
Joey, the new chair will be here in an hour.
喬伊，新椅子一小時內就會送來

166
00:11:13,570 --> 00:11:16,160
Maybe we should move Rosita out of here.
或許我們該把蘿希塔搬出去

167
00:11:16,370 --> 00:11:18,670
Start the healing process.
開始療傷止痛

168
00:11:19,740 --> 00:11:21,370
Yeah, I guess you're right.
好吧，我猜你說的對

169
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,860
She's healed!
她好了！

170
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:50,030
That's weird.
那太奇怪了 

171
00:11:50,270 --> 00:11:51,700
No, it's not weird.
不，一點都不奇怪

172
00:11:51,910 --> 00:11:53,460
It's a miracle!
這是奇跡！

173
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:57,580
It's not a miracle. I'm sure there's an explanation.
這不是奇跡 我相信這一定有合理的解釋

174
00:11:57,780 --> 00:12:01,980
There is. If your heart is pure,  wondrous things can happen.
沒錯，只要你的心地純正 奇跡一定會發生

175
00:12:04,550 --> 00:12:07,210
She'll understand. I didn't do it on purpose.
她會瞭解的，我不是故意的

176
00:12:07,420 --> 00:12:08,980
Dad, that won't matter to her.
爸，對她來說那並不重要

177
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:11,590
Look, all my stuff is safe and dry.
你看，我的箱子完全沒事

178
00:12:11,830 --> 00:12:13,290
And all her stuff is...
她的東西都…

179
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:16,390
growing new stuff.
長出新的東西了

180
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:18,330
This is the kind of thing...
就是這樣的事…

181
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:21,730
that makes her think you love me more than you lovr her.
讓她認為你們愛我更勝於愛她

182
00:12:22,100 --> 00:12:24,000
Oh my God. Does she realy think that?
天啊，她真的那麼認為？

183
00:12:24,210 --> 00:12:25,500
-Well, can you blame her? -I don't know.
-你能怪她嗎？ -我不知道

184
00:12:26,610 --> 00:12:30,130
We may have favored you unconsciously. You were a marvel.
或許我們在潛意識裡 是偏愛你的，你是個奇跡

185
00:12:30,340 --> 00:12:33,710
-The doctors said your mom couldn't.. -I don't want to hear about it.
-醫生說你媽沒辦法… -我不想聽

186
00:12:33,910 --> 00:12:36,540
-Really? -Well, not right now.
-真的嗎？ -現在不想

187
00:12:37,350 --> 00:12:41,340
Monica came here for some memories. Damn it, we'll give her some.
摩妮卡來這裡找回憶 該死，我們得給她一些回憶

188
00:12:41,620 --> 00:12:43,350
Okay, grab...
好吧，拿…

189
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:46,690
Grab some boxes. We'll take stuff from mine...
把空箱子拿過來 我們拿一些我的東西…

190
00:12:46,930 --> 00:12:51,160
and whatever we can pass off as hers, we'll put in there.
放在這些箱子裡 只要能騙過她的就行

191
00:12:52,070 --> 00:12:54,230
Like, this. She could have made this.
譬如說這個，這可能是她做的

192
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:56,660
-This could have been hers. -Sure.
-這可能是她的 -沒錯

193
00:12:59,270 --> 00:13:04,400
If you want to tell the medical marvel story while we work, that'd be fine.
現在是告訴我那個「醫學奇跡」 的適當時機了

194
00:13:08,020 --> 00:13:11,580
I am so psyched I kept this chair for myself.
我好高興我能把這張椅子 留下來給自己用

195
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:17,650
Yeah. Me too.
對，我也是

196
00:13:20,730 --> 00:13:25,170
You know, this thing has speakers in the headrest?
你知道這張椅子的頭墊上 還附了喇叭嗎？

197
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:26,730
-No, really? -Yeah.
-不，真的嗎？ -沒錯

198
00:13:26,970 --> 00:13:29,400
You can hook it to the TV and you get radio.
你可以把它跟電視機接在一起 還可以聽收音機

199
00:13:34,940 --> 00:13:37,070
My chair heals itself.
我的椅子有自療的功能

200
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:42,380
All right. Let's just forget about the people at the office, okay?
好吧，我們別提 辦公室的同事了，好嗎？

201
00:13:42,620 --> 00:13:46,380
There's gotta be someone worth sticking around for.
一定有人值得你留戀

202
00:13:46,590 --> 00:13:50,550
What about family or friends? Maybe a girlfriend?
你的家人跟朋友呢？ 或許你有女朋友？

203
00:13:51,290 --> 00:13:52,550
Yeah, right.
是啊

204
00:13:52,830 --> 00:13:54,820
Oh, sorry. Boyfriend?
喔，抱歉，你的男朋友呢？

205
00:13:56,130 --> 00:13:57,290
Okay, I should...
好了，我應該…

206
00:13:57,570 --> 00:14:00,090
be getting back to my thing now.
去做我想做的事了

207
00:14:00,330 --> 00:14:01,890
See you.
再見

208
00:14:02,100 --> 00:14:04,900
I'm not finished! Don't you dare hang up on me!
我還沒有說完！你休想掛我電話！

209
00:14:05,770 --> 00:14:07,800
The new girl's good.
新來的女同事真的有一套

210
00:14:10,610 --> 00:14:12,410
Which boxes are mine?
哪些箱子是我的？

211
00:14:12,610 --> 00:14:15,140
-These are yours right here. -Okay.
-你的箱子在這裡 -好吧

212
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:17,310
A coloring book.
著色簿

213
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:19,210
You loved that thing.
你喜歡那個玩意

214
00:14:19,420 --> 00:14:22,150
You never went anywhere without...
你去哪裡都會…

215
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:24,290
without that coloring book.
都會帶著那本著色簿

216
00:14:24,530 --> 00:14:25,690
Really?
真的嗎？

217
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:28,550
Looks like I had trouble staying in the lines.
看起來我老是沒辦法 把顏色塗在線裡

218
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:30,290
Nuh-uh!
不

219
00:14:31,900 --> 00:14:32,990
Wow, look at this.
哇，你看這個

220
00:14:33,270 --> 00:14:36,070
I can't believe I even fit into this shirt.
我不敢相信以前我穿得下這件T恤

221
00:14:36,442 --> 00:14:38,171
（暴龍 羅斯）

222
00:14:40,770 --> 00:14:42,000
Oh, this is yours.
喔，這是你的

223
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:45,040
I don't know how that got in there.
我不知道它怎麼會跑到那裡去

224
00:14:46,910 --> 00:14:48,910
Hey, this isn't my stuff.
嘿，這不是我的東西

225
00:14:49,150 --> 00:14:52,480
Ross, these are your boxes.
羅斯，這些是你的箱子

226
00:14:56,090 --> 00:14:57,790
Where are my boxes?
我的箱子在哪裡？

227
00:14:58,830 --> 00:15:03,660
The garage flooded, sweetie, and ruined your boxes. I'm sorry.
車庫淹水，親愛的 你的箱子都進了水，對不起

228
00:15:04,370 --> 00:15:05,390
Just mine?
只有我的箱子進水了？

229
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,190
I'm afraid so.
恐怕是那樣的

230
00:15:07,430 --> 00:15:10,730
Why wasn't Ross' stuff ruined?
為什麼羅斯的東西都沒壞？

231
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:15,300
I used your boxes to divert water away from the Porsche.
我用你的箱子擋水來保護我的保時捷

232
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:18,210
Ross' stuff is fine,  but I have no memories...
羅斯的東西都沒事 但我什麼回憶都沒有了…

233
00:15:18,410 --> 00:15:21,400
so you could keep the bottom of your car from water?
只為了你不希望 你的汽車底盤碰到水？

234
00:15:21,620 --> 00:15:24,240
There was also leaves and gook and stuff.
水裡有樹葉、泥巴跟雜物

235
00:15:27,190 --> 00:15:28,550
I can't believe this!
我不敢相信！

236
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:37,590
Screw it. I'm having one.
去他的，我要抽根煙

237
00:15:42,470 --> 00:15:44,370
-Hey, Chandler. -Hey.
-嘿，錢德 -嘿

238
00:15:44,570 --> 00:15:47,730
How'd you like to sit in a chair that reclines...
你要不要試試看一張可以平躺…

239
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:50,030
has a rolling massage...
有滾輪按摩功能…

240
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:52,580
and speakers in the headrest?
頭墊還附了喇叭的椅子？

241
00:15:52,780 --> 00:15:54,840
I've tried that so many times...
我試過很多次…

242
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:57,950
they won't even let me in the store anymore.
但他們已經不再讓我走進他們店裡

243
00:15:59,550 --> 00:16:02,750
What if I said you could do it in my apartment?
如果我說你可以到我家試坐一下呢？

244
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:04,220
Are you telling me...
你是說…

245
00:16:04,460 --> 00:16:07,790
you bought the chair that makes all others obsolete?
你買了那張讓其他椅子 都變成廢物的椅子？

246
00:16:08,060 --> 00:16:12,800
The chair that Sit Magazine called "Chair of the Year"?
那張《椅子雜誌》封為 「年度最佳椅子」的椅子？

247
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:15,660
I just purchased...
我剛剛買了…

248
00:16:15,900 --> 00:16:20,100
the La-Z-Boy E-Cliner 3000.
懶男孩E傾斜3000型

249
00:16:20,310 --> 00:16:22,570
Well, that's awesome! That's great! What made you do it?
喔，那真的是太棒了！太帥了！ 你為什麼會買下它？

250
00:16:22,780 --> 00:16:25,750
It's a long story, but,  I broke Joey's chair..
說來話長，但我弄壞了喬伊的椅子…

251
00:16:25,950 --> 00:16:28,640
Whoa, whoa, whoa. You broke Joey's chair?
哇…你弄壞了喬伊的椅子？

252
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:32,250
I thought I did, that's why I replaced it with mine.
我以為是我幹的 所以我用我的椅子跟它調包

253
00:16:33,890 --> 00:16:36,380
That's how it got fixed!
所以它才會完全沒事！

254
00:16:36,820 --> 00:16:39,950
You thought that elves came in and fixed it?
你以為是妖精把它修好的？

255
00:16:40,160 --> 00:16:41,530
No.
不

256
00:16:41,830 --> 00:16:43,630
Angels.
是天使干的

257
00:16:44,770 --> 00:16:46,760
I'm getting my chair back.
我要把我的椅子拿回來

258
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:53,200
Well, looks like it wasn't healed after all!
喔，看起來它根本沒有自療功能！

259
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:57,040
I guess this chair's mine now.
我猜這張椅子是我的了

260
00:17:00,350 --> 00:17:02,010
Joey, you broke my chair!
喬伊，你弄壞了我的椅子！

261
00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:03,210
Your chair?
你的椅子？

262
00:17:03,450 --> 00:17:06,420
He thought he broke it,  so he switched chairs.
他以為他把它弄壞了 所以他調換了椅子

263
00:17:06,620 --> 00:17:08,320
So there was no miracle?
奇跡根本不存在？

264
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:10,320
No, Joe. No miracle.
沒錯，喬伊，奇跡不存在

265
00:17:10,620 --> 00:17:12,560
Oh, no! This is devastating!
喔，不！這真的是太糟糕了！

266
00:17:14,430 --> 00:17:18,830
My faith is shaken. I'm glad I have a new chair to get me through this.
我的信念被擊垮了，我很高興 這張新椅子能陪我走過這一切

267
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:25,430
Where can I find Earl? He's the supply manager here.
請問厄爾在哪裡？他是總務部經理

268
00:17:25,670 --> 00:17:27,070
I don't know any Earl.
我不認識厄爾

269
00:17:27,310 --> 00:17:29,570
I'm right here!
我在這裡！

270
00:17:32,980 --> 00:17:34,380
Earl?
厄爾？

271
00:17:36,250 --> 00:17:37,580
I'm Phoebe.
我是菲比

272
00:17:37,820 --> 00:17:39,180
Phoebe?
菲比？

273
00:17:39,390 --> 00:17:41,750
The lady who sells toner?
賣碳粉的小姐？

274
00:17:41,990 --> 00:17:44,650
Look, you can't kill yourself.
聽著，你不能自殺

275
00:17:45,330 --> 00:17:48,020
Look, I really appreciate you coming down..
我很感激你趕過來…

276
00:17:48,230 --> 00:17:49,890
No, I can't let you do it.
不，我不能讓你那麼做

277
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:54,360
-Why? -Because, fate made me call you today.
-為什麼？ -因為命運讓我今天打電話給你

278
00:17:54,570 --> 00:17:56,260
I thought it was toner.
我還以為你是打電話來賣碳粉

279
00:17:57,910 --> 00:18:01,270
Think about it, okay? This isn't even my regular job.
好好想一想，好嗎？ 這根本不是我的正職

280
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:04,680
My first day, you're my first call.
我第一天上班就第一個打電話給你

281
00:18:04,910 --> 00:18:08,470
Somebody else may have hung up, but I wouldn't do that...
其他人可能會掛掉電話 但我不會那麼做…

282
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:10,550
because I know about this stuff.
因為我瞭解這種事

283
00:18:10,780 --> 00:18:13,480
-My mom killed herself. -Really?
-我媽是自殺的 -真的嗎？

284
00:18:13,890 --> 00:18:14,880
How?
她怎麼自殺的？

285
00:18:15,090 --> 00:18:16,680
I'm not gonna give you tips.
我絕不會教你

286
00:18:18,690 --> 00:18:20,490
Don't you see that this...
你看不出來…

287
00:18:20,690 --> 00:18:24,560
all came together so I could stop you from doing this?
這些都是注定好的 所以我才會來阻止你自殺？

288
00:18:25,430 --> 00:18:29,130
-Couldn't it just be a coincidence? -No, it's fate.
-這不是巧合嗎？ -不，這是命中注定

289
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:33,100
It doesn't really seem like enough to be fate.
它看起來不像是命中注定

290
00:18:33,370 --> 00:18:34,500
Oh, well.
喔，好吧

291
00:18:34,710 --> 00:18:36,570
Okay, here's a weird thing.
好吧，有件事很奇怪

292
00:18:36,810 --> 00:18:40,910
My mother was also a supply manager.
我媽媽也是總務部經理

293
00:18:42,450 --> 00:18:44,310
I'm actually the office manager.
事實上我是辦公室經理

294
00:18:44,550 --> 00:18:46,540
Oh, my God! So was she!
我的天啊！她也是！

295
00:18:46,750 --> 00:18:48,950
And get this, okay.
還有這個，好吧

296
00:18:49,220 --> 00:18:52,820
Your name is Earl, right? Her name was Pearl.
你是厄爾，對吧？她叫做普厄兒

297
00:18:53,090 --> 00:18:55,290
Puh-Earl.
普…厄爾

298
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:58,260
Was there anything else?
還有別的證據嗎？

299
00:18:58,470 --> 00:18:59,520
Sure.
當然有

300
00:19:02,300 --> 00:19:03,290
Where're you from?
你是哪裡人？

301
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:06,170
-Philadelphia. -Oh, my God, so was she!
-費城 -喔，我的天啊，她也是！

302
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:09,840
I've got goose bumps.
我都起雞皮疙瘩了

303
00:19:10,310 --> 00:19:11,300
Really?
真的嗎？

304
00:19:11,550 --> 00:19:13,640
I'm wearing layers, and it's warm.
我穿太多了，而且這裡很熱

305
00:19:15,280 --> 00:19:17,550
These jerks might not care about you...
或許這些混蛋不在乎你…

306
00:19:17,780 --> 00:19:21,650
but the universe does, and that says a lot.
但宇宙在乎你，那才是最重要的

307
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:25,320
Did you hear that?
你們聽到了嗎？

308
00:19:25,830 --> 00:19:28,290
I don't need you guys to care about me...
我不需要你們在乎我…

309
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,590
because the universe cares!
因為宇宙在乎我

310
00:19:30,830 --> 00:19:33,160
The whole universe!
整個宇宙在乎我！

311
00:19:38,570 --> 00:19:41,600
I really wish they'd care a little bit.
我真的希望他們能在乎我一下

312
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:44,940
Oh, this is terrible.
喔，這真的是太可怕了

313
00:19:45,180 --> 00:19:47,170
Everything is destroyed.
所有的東西都毀了

314
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:49,600
Look at this.
你看這個

315
00:19:49,850 --> 00:19:54,080
It meant enough for me to save, and now I can't tell what it is.
它一定很重要我才會保存它 現在我看不出來它是什麼東西

316
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:57,380
It's still soft.
它還軟軟的

317
00:19:59,890 --> 00:20:01,790
What do you think this is?
你覺得它是什麼呢？

318
00:20:03,460 --> 00:20:05,330
I think it was a mouse.
我想它是老鼠

319
00:20:13,910 --> 00:20:16,740
-How are you, honey? -How do you think I am?
-你還好嗎？甜心 -你覺得呢？

320
00:20:16,980 --> 00:20:19,410
You've wrecked my childhood memories...
你毀了我的童年回憶…

321
00:20:19,650 --> 00:20:21,340
you love Ross more than me.
你們愛羅斯比愛我多

322
00:20:21,620 --> 00:20:24,410
And I just rubbed a dead mouse on my face.
我剛剛還拿死了的老鼠碰我的臉

323
00:20:26,620 --> 00:20:30,920
Sweetheart, we love you just as much as Ross.
甜心，我們愛你就像我們愛羅斯

324
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:33,060
I'm sorry about what happened...
箱子的事我很抱歉…

325
00:20:33,330 --> 00:20:36,730
and I probably can't make it up to you...
也許我永遠沒辦法補償你…

326
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,830
but here's a start.
但這是個開始

327
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:44,860
-What's this? -It's the key to my Porsche.
-這是什麼？ -我的保時捷的鑰匙

328
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:47,230
Well, the key to your Porsche.
你的保時捷的鑰匙

329
00:20:48,410 --> 00:20:49,500
What?
什麼？！

330
00:20:49,710 --> 00:20:51,340
What?!
什麼？！

331
00:20:52,410 --> 00:20:57,410
I've considered getting rid of it. I saw my reflection the other day.
我一直想把它賣掉 有天我在車子看到自己的倒影

332
00:20:57,680 --> 00:21:00,850
Your mother's right, I do look like an ass.
你媽說的對，我看起來像個癟三

333
00:21:02,020 --> 00:21:04,680
You're giving it to me? You're kidding.
你要把它送給我？你一定是在開玩笑

334
00:21:04,890 --> 00:21:07,860
Well, wait a minute.
等一下

335
00:21:08,060 --> 00:21:11,760
A couple of stupid boxes get wet, and she gets a Porsche?
幾箱蠢東西濕掉了 她就可以拿到保時捷？

336
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:15,890
-Let's take a drive? -All right!
-我們去兜個風吧 -太帥了！

337
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:19,730
What about me? I'm a medical marvel!
我呢？我是醫學奇跡！

338
00:21:34,420 --> 00:21:35,720
Hey, guys.
嘿，你們都在

339
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:37,790
Have you seen Chandler's chair?
你們看到錢德的椅子了嗎？

340
00:21:38,030 --> 00:21:40,050
Joey broke it. He got rid of it.
喬伊把它弄壞了，於是他把它丟了

341
00:21:40,260 --> 00:21:44,460
Are you kidding? I get a Porsche and the Barcalounger's gone?
你在開玩笑嗎？我得到了保時捷 而且巴卡蘭格被丟掉了？

342
00:21:44,670 --> 00:21:47,760
This is the best day ever!
這是有史以來最棒的一天

343
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


344
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


